    <MESSAGE value="**Add multi-port support for Kubernetes payload validation and rendering**  &#10;&#10;- Implement validation and error handling for `k8s.ports` array in addition to the legacy single `k8s.port` field.&#10;- Enhance manifest rendering to support multiple service and container ports, handling optional `name` and `protocol` fields.&#10;- Auto-generate unique port names when multiple unnamed ports are provided.&#10;- Support `liveness_port`, `readiness_port`, and `ingress.port` as integers or port names.&#10;- Update frontend to allow dynamic addition and management of multiple ports in the deployment form. &#10;- Reflect changes in `README.md` to document updated Kubernetes payload specification." />
    <MESSAGE value="Replace all references of &quot;sebrus_mail&quot; with &quot;sebrus_apps&quot; in configuration files, paths, and manifests." />
    <MESSAGE value="Add multi-port entry support in Kubernetes deployment form&#10;&#10;- Allow service and container ports to be specified as comma-separated lists (e.g., `8000, 8081`) for efficient multi-port configuration.&#10;- Add validation for port ranges, alignment between service and container ports, and naming constraints for multi-port rows.&#10;- Expand backend logic to handle multiple ports per row, enabling better support for complex Kubernetes payloads.&#10;- Enhance frontend UI with hints about multi-port entry and streamlined row expansion." />
    <MESSAGE value="**Keep &quot;Kind&quot; dropdown visible for all target types**&#10;&#10;- Ensure the &quot;Kind&quot; dropdown remains displayed even with a single option, supporting better legacy configuration handling.&#10;- Automatically pre-select a lone option, but retain placeholder logic for multiple options.&#10;- Refactor related UI logic in `portal.modals.js` and `portal.deploy.js` for consistency." />
    <MESSAGE value="**Add Frappe cache-busting mechanism to Dockerfile and pipeline**&#10;&#10;- Introduce `FRAPPE_CACHE_BUSTER` to ensure latest Frappe commits are cloned during Docker build, preventing stale layers from being reused.&#10;- Update Azure pipeline to resolve the latest Frappe `version-16` commit and pass it as a build argument.&#10;- Extend Docker build arguments to include `FRAPPE_CACHE_BUSTER`, mirroring the existing `PORTAL_CACHE_BUSTER` logic for consistency." />
    <MESSAGE value="**Simplify hint rendering logic in `portal.deploy.js`**&#10;&#10;- Remove redundant hint rendering for scoped environment overrides.&#10;- Adjust deployment form to streamline hint presentation and improve clarity.&#10;- Maintain consistent styling and logic flow for better user experience." />
    <MESSAGE value="**Refactor deployment logic with improved error handling and clean formatting**&#10;&#10;- Simplify code by consistently applying indentation across string replacements and SQL queries.&#10;- Enhance `update_env_health` to ensure deployment attribution reflects actual deploy logs, avoiding contamination from live sync viewers.&#10;- Improve `upsert_env_status` logic to handle attribution and status updates distinctly, adhering to deploy-specific attribution rules.&#10;- Adjust and refactor tests to maintain code clarity, validate proper attribution mechanics, and ensure robust Kubernetes payload validation." />
